  <item>
    <title>NO.4对话｜和背刺我的女人聊聊职场的分岔路口</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6686883dae8e21859a86db78</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6686883dae8e21859a86db78</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 11:32:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾我请来了我的工作partner—元芳，这是一期极其随性和随机的节目，录于今天也想发布于今天，是一种来自于我们这段工作关系的及时记录，也是对这个“背刺”我的女人对我“抛弃”的认证，她的25岁任性而为，我愿意尊重且支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>show notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a>来自98年元芳的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>我和元芳的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>为什么选择在这个时间点提离职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>彼此认知里，影视行业制作VS宣传营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 营销是一种命题作文，而制作是一种创作性表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>营销和制作所需要的核心技能是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a>我和元芳回忆初次见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a>我们在项目里遇到的第一个大坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>元芳记忆里最深刻的小事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a>遇到一个会怼人的领导是何感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>印象里我对元芳的发火场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a>原来在你眼里天大的事儿居然是这个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>为什么选择在这个时间当了“逃兵”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>背刺我，元芳是什么心情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a>我们俩如何看待“机会”这两个字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>总要有人先迈出第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>契机就像人生的“刮刮乐”，有可能是中奖，更可能是谢谢惠顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>尽管元芳心理很难过，也还是要早点做出选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a>放弃现在的工作机会而直接换个工种，会后悔么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a>为彼此留下一句话，居然是希望我注意健康！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a>自己的路自己选，怎么走都行。绊倒了大不了就地躺会呗</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望我们在彼此职场的不同路径里，都能越走越好，殊途同归～半年后继续相约part 2 ，这一次的职场分岔路口，是何感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anthony Lazaro-Moody Wind</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhFeLC0RsSpEu09-gn0vt-IbtyNw.m4a" length="32438953" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhwg-tn7JQb4A_06p6QSI2r-RYja.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.3刘亦菲《玫瑰的故事》持靓行凶，神仙姐姐也逃不出爱情的大坑啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66728731c26e396a36de4bcf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66728731c26e396a36de4bcf</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《玫瑰的故事》正在热播，亦舒的作品再一次被搬上了荧幕。本期节目聊了聊原著小说和剧版呈现的不同以及创新性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄亦玫🎙️：“从此世界在我面前指向我想去的任何地方，我完全而绝对的主持着我”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果说亦舒的小说讲的是精神自由的黄玫瑰在爱情中寻找自我的故事，而剧版则要传达的是黄亦玫纯粹的价值观。无论是走入一段关系还是离开一段关系，能对自己的选择负责和承担后果，更不会被男性定义价值。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTdjpiOXOSDGDO5OmrKoIZkxS5O.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>show notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 亦舒笔下的黄玫瑰变成了黄亦玫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a>为何黄亦玫将的出身改编成中产家庭&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a>剧版人设从离经叛道的女人改编成不谙世事的少女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 职场线的加入带来了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a>亦舒笔下的女性独立是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 原著小说与剧集在时尚与审美价值方面的价值观传递</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 刘亦菲的美女效应给剧集在时尚穿搭上面带来了不小的声量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>含着金汤匙出生的黄亦玫也逃不过男人们的大坑 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a>我把你当前辈，你竟然想出轨，把我当小三？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>男女视角切入：普信男周世辉</span><strong><span>VS</span></strong><span>黄亦玫 如何看待同一段关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a>女人的觉醒都是从苦和痛开始的&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a>初恋如同一场暴风雨，来时猛烈，去时决然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 黄亦玫的初恋庄国栋，从一场宴会的一见钟情开启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a>用吻和sex解决不了实际中的任何感情问题&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>冷暴力、异地、上岸第一箭先斩意中人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 精英男的爱情是要为其个人的职业发展和利益让步的，女人不过是他餐盘里的一个甜品，或者是早晚会穿腻了的一件衣服而已</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 仙女下凡遇到了第二个男人方协文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>黄亦玫从不被社会所规训，爱就在一起，不爱就离开&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rose Whispers(玫瑰私语)-刘恋</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh03HKcV75H-5QDADy_uFKX_kYbX.m4a" length="24120596" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhwg-tn7JQb4A_06p6QSI2r-RYja.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.2《我爱我很棒》，余秀华、完颜慧德这对“敌蜜”我先磕了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6671139fc26e396a36942d9e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6671139fc26e396a36942d9e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 04:57:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《我爱我很棒》，余秀华、完颜慧德这对“敌蜜”可真有意思～</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个是身残志不残的务实理智派，却是个放荡不羁爱自由的女诗人</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个是希望世界千万别关注我的小透明，却是个心理咨询师&amp;网络主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>这对儿敌蜜请🔒锁死，我爱看♥️</span></p><span></span><p><span>show notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a>两个牛马不相及的余秀华和完颜慧德相聚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>《穿越大半个中国去睡你》女诗人竟然是个理智派</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>N人和S人的特性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a>余秀华曾经那轰轰烈烈的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>追溯完颜慧德的原生家庭与经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 完颜慧德拉黑4900多“黑粉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>完余“敌蜜”之战一触即发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a>余秀华说完颜慧德是“装在套子里的人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 身受男权影响下的两种自证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a>为什么我最亲密的妈妈会用这么难堪的词语来形容自己的女儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 任何一句话都是多义的而非单义的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a>根本不存在自愈，而只存在于你怎么面对</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>G大调第一大提琴组前奏曲-秦立巍</span></p><span></span><p><span>Long Way Home-皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Soldier's Sweetheart-曹芙嘉&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhKHS4knBV0nCQfp-JO8RXGogQy9.m4a" length="15023562" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhwg-tn7JQb4A_06p6QSI2r-RYja.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.1三十岁，就是我的十八岁成人礼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6665721b94977a26ef321625</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6665721b94977a26ef321625</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 09:12:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没有动力的时候，发发呆也挺好的。</span><br><span>这句是我这两年听到最悦耳的话。</span><br><span>三十岁来了，我不慌，反而觉得我终于迎来了属于我的成人礼🎈</span></p><span></span><p><span>show notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 晓颜的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>三十岁为什么就对女人重要了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>三十岁晚上的一头雾水？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a>曾经一路被封为卷王的我，满意现在么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a>没达成别人眼中的期待，我其实很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>30岁零点，是我的十八岁成人礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a>为什么做播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a>感恩遇见，我的声音笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期bgm</span></p><span></span><p><span>逆行宇宙-王赫野</span><br><span>值得心疼的她-陈筱舒</span><br><span>夜空（影视剧《春色寄情人》插曲）-陈婧霏</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr8g7bOEttBmh70EjPnnLS6VxFNv.m4a" length="10641208" type="audio/mp4"/>
